      "content": "Awesome, thanks. Let's get started then. I don't want to get bogged down in boring statistics about GDP or trade balances—that's what they use to argue against us. \n\nI want the speech to focus on our duty as a global leader and the idea that human suffering shouldn't be ignored just because it's happening across a border. Could you draft a few paragraphs that really lean into that moral obligation? Make it feel like we have a responsibility to act, no matter the cost. I want the donors to feel like supporting us isn't just a choice, but the right thing to do.",
